          Severity: MODERATE                                                                                 
          Affected versions of tornado are vulnerable to Exposure of Sensitive Information to an Unauthorized
          Actor / Operation on a Resource after Expiration or Release. The optional CurlAsyncHTTPClient      
          backend pools and reuses pycurl handles without fully resetting them between requests. Per-request 
          client TLS certificates (SSLCERT/SSLKEY), proxy basic-auth credentials (PROXYUSERPWD), and network 
